<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="CGF1_MWP_SemiBattleRifle_T2">
		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type60_Sniper_</defName>
		<label>Type 60 Sniper</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x39mm. 10-round internal mag. Semi-Automatic.
		
The Type 60 Sniper is a rather nebulous weapon in PLA service - extnerally, it appears to be a Type 56 copy of the Soviet SKS rifle but with a significantly longer barrel, though any other modifications are unknown. Such rifles were intended for marksman purposes in the era where the Type 56 was the standard infantry arm of the PLA, making the Type 60 the likely result of attempts to simplify logistics.</description>
